    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The target of the spell is granted a bonus of +20% to his WP; at the beginning of his next turn he can also reroll any WP test he has failed within the last round, such as Fear or Terror tests, unless the failed test has already caused a permanent effect. It can also be used offensively, reducing a target’s WP by -20% and forcing him to reroll any successful WP test.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>"
